好吧，主要是在南部和沿海地区。

797
00:31:52.440 --> 00:31:53.080
Coupon.
Coupon。

798
00:31:53.480 --> 00:31:54.120
Yeah.
是啊。

799
00:31:54.360 --> 00:31:54.680
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

800
00:31:55.020 --> 00:31:59.500
But then Cambridge University did a study on how English people pronounce it, and that
但后来剑桥大学做了一项关于英国人如何发音的研究，结果显示

801
00:31:59.500 --> 00:32:02.060
data showed that 61% of people say coupon.
数据显示有61%的人读作coupon。

802
00:32:02.940 --> 00:32:04.480
So, I think we need our own poll.
所以，我觉得我们需要自己做个民调。

803
00:32:04.680 --> 00:32:05.540
Coupon or coupon?
是读coupon还是coupon？

804
00:32:06.460 --> 00:32:07.120
All right.
好吧。

805
00:32:07.300 --> 00:32:08.300
Where are we?
我们讲到哪了？

806
00:32:08.580 --> 00:32:12.340
Well, Dwight is the Scranton Strangler, and he's going to sneak up behind Jim.
嗯，德怀特是斯克兰顿勒杀手，他正要从背后偷袭吉姆。

807
00:32:12.760 --> 00:32:14.360
Oh, I have a question about this.
哦，我有个关于这个的问题。

808
00:32:14.480 --> 00:32:14.960
What is it?
什么问题？

809
00:32:15.180 --> 00:32:18.400
Dwight sees Pam and thinks she's mocking his mother.
德怀特看到帕姆，以为她在嘲笑他妈妈。

810
00:32:18.780 --> 00:32:19.040
Right.
没错。

811
00:32:19.280 --> 00:32:19.600
Right?
是吗？

812
00:32:19.780 --> 00:32:20.020
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

813
00:32:20.240 --> 00:32:24.420
He says that Pam is only a third as beautiful as his mom and half her height.
他说帕姆的美貌只有他妈妈的三分之一，身高也只有他妈妈的一半。

814
00:32:25.040 --> 00:32:25.500
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

815
00:32:25.820 --> 00:32:27.120
How tall is Dwight's mom?
德怀特的妈妈有多高？

816
00:32:27.260 --> 00:32:27.880
Very tall.
非常高。

817
00:32:28.040 --> 00:32:28.880
How tall are you, Jenna?
珍娜，你有多高？

818
00:32:29.100 --> 00:32:30.300
I'm 5'6".
我身高5英尺6英寸。

819
00:32:30.300 --> 00:32:31.620
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

820
00:32:31.620 --> 00:32:35.320
That is hilarious.
那太搞笑了。

821
00:32:35.940 --> 00:32:39.360
I loved this olive oil costume, I'd like to say.
我想说，我超爱这套橄榄油服装。

822
00:32:39.360 --> 00:32:40.880
I had the best time.
我玩得非常开心。

823
00:32:41.380 --> 00:32:46.520
Alicia Raycraft, our costume designer, did all the costumes with her team for this episode.
我们的服装设计师艾丽西亚·雷克拉夫特和她的团队为这一集制作了所有的服装。

824
00:32:46.800 --> 00:32:48.160
I thought they did a great job.
我觉得她们做得太棒了。

825
00:32:48.160 --> 00:32:49.400
Fantastic job, Alicia.
干得漂亮，艾丽西亚。

826
00:32:49.400 --> 00:32:56.820
She built my olive oil costume from scratch, and she even sent me my fitting photo of me with all the pins in it.
她从零开始为我制作了橄榄油服装，甚至还发给我一张试装照，上面还别着所有的别针。

827
00:32:56.900 --> 00:32:58.180
So we'll have to post that.
所以我们得把那张照片发出来。

828
00:32:58.280 --> 00:32:58.940
That's awesome.
太棒了。

829
00:32:59.120 --> 00:32:59.580
I know.
我知道。

830
00:32:59.580 --> 00:33:02.160
And I loved the whole wig and all the everything.
而且我喜欢整个假发和所有的细节。

831
00:33:03.020 --> 00:33:03.880
It was great.
那真的很棒。

832
00:33:04.800 --> 00:33:10.760
The wig would kind of bounce a little, like the olive oil ponytail would kind of flip-flip-flip-flip-flip.
假发会有点弹跳，橄榄油的马尾辫会晃来晃去。

833
00:33:11.040 --> 00:33:17.500
The only problem was that at lunch, I couldn't lay down because they didn't want to take the wig on and off.
唯一的问题是午餐时我没法躺下，因为她们不想把假发摘下来再戴上去。

834
00:33:17.600 --> 00:33:18.780
Once it was on, it was on.
一旦戴上，就不能摘。

835
00:33:18.880 --> 00:33:19.000
Yeah.
是啊。

836
00:33:19.000 --> 00:33:23.700
And so I couldn't put my head back even on, like, the couch or anything.
所以我连头都没法靠在沙发之类的东西上。

837
00:33:23.900 --> 00:33:26.060
Yeah, that was my problem when I had to be the nurse.
是啊，我演护士的时候也遇到过这个问题。

838
00:33:26.520 --> 00:33:27.000
Oh.
哦。

839
00:33:27.080 --> 00:33:29.940
Because they bobby-pinned that thing into my head, the little hat.
因为她们用发夹把那个小帽子死死地别在我的头上。

840
00:33:30.540 --> 00:33:33.940
Pam really wants Jim to wear a Popeye costume.
帕姆真的很想让吉姆穿大力水手的服装。

841
00:33:34.240 --> 00:33:36.700
Yeah, she wants the whole family to be dressed up.
是啊，她想让全家人都打扮起来。

842
00:33:36.760 --> 00:33:37.900
He's not doing it.
他才不会穿呢。

843
00:33:38.640 --> 00:33:40.780
You know, he's not much of a costume guy.
你知道的，他不太喜欢穿奇装异服。

844
00:33:40.920 --> 00:33:41.160
No.
确实。

845
00:33:41.660 --> 00:33:43.380
You know who is a costume guy?
你知道谁喜欢穿吗？

846
00:33:44.400 --> 00:33:45.380
Apparently, Gabe.
显然是盖博。

847
00:33:46.120 --> 00:33:48.300
Gabe goes all out as Lady Gaga.
盖博扮成Lady Gaga，真是豁出去了。

848
00:33:48.640 --> 00:33:48.960
Yeah.
是啊。

849
00:33:49.500 --> 00:33:51.480
We had a fan catch from Kayla M.
我们收到了一条来自华盛顿特区凯拉·M的粉丝发现。

850
00:33:51.620 --> 00:33:52.660
in Washington, D.C.
在华盛顿特区。

851
00:33:53.020 --> 00:33:53.960
Hi, ladies.
嗨，女士们。

852
00:33:54.020 --> 00:34:00.760
I was watching Community Season 2, Episode 26, and Dean Pelton was dressed up as Lady Gaga.
我当时在看《废柴联盟》第二季第26集，迪恩·佩尔顿打扮成了Lady Gaga。

853
00:34:01.340 --> 00:34:06.220
This reminded me of the time the Gabe dressed as Lady Gaga in Costume Contest,
这让我想起了盖博在《化妆舞会》那一集里打扮成Lady Gaga的时候，

854
00:34:06.300 --> 00:34:09.700
so I decided to look up the air dates for both episodes,
所以我决定去查一下这两集的播出日期，

855
00:34:09.700 --> 00:34:14.900
and they premiered on the same night, and they're dressed almost identically.
结果发现它们是在同一个晚上首播的，而且他们的装扮几乎一模一样。

856
00:34:15.180 --> 00:34:16.000
That's hilarious.
太搞笑了。

857
00:34:16.020 --> 00:34:17.220
I looked up the pictures.
我查了照片。

858
00:34:17.660 --> 00:34:21.160
Kayla's not the first person to notice this because all over Reddit,
凯拉并不是第一个发现这一点的人，因为在Reddit上到处都是，

859
00:34:21.540 --> 00:34:27.040
there are these screenshots side-by-side of these two characters from the same night.
这些截图把这两个角色在同一晚的装扮放在了一起对比。

860
00:34:27.140 --> 00:34:28.040
Will you send me that?
你能发给我吗？

861
00:34:28.160 --> 00:34:28.920
I sure will.
当然可以。

862
00:34:29.540 --> 00:34:32.140
Well, Gabe is holding a meeting with all of the sales team,
盖博召集了所有销售团队开会，

863
00:34:32.180 --> 00:34:37.800
and he announces that the warehouse workers are now going to be able to make sales during their deliveries
他宣布仓库员工现在可以在送货时进行销售，

864
00:34:37.800 --> 00:34:41.140
and that they will split the commissions with the sales team.
并且他们将与销售团队平分佣金。

865
00:34:41.280 --> 00:34:42.640
This is actually really good news.
这其实是个非常好的消息。

866
00:34:42.820 --> 00:34:48.300
You know, the sales team doesn't seem to like this, but I thought it sounded pretty good
你知道，销售团队似乎不太喜欢这样，但我认为这听起来很不错，

867
00:34:48.300 --> 00:34:54.160
because you'd almost have this surrogate salesperson out selling on your route,
因为你几乎相当于有了一个代理销售员在你的路线上帮你卖货，

868
00:34:54.160 --> 00:34:58.100
maybe being able to tap into a need that you wouldn't know about.
也许能挖掘出你原本不知道的需求。

869
00:34:58.100 --> 00:35:05.060
Well, there's a really funny deleted scenes, it's on the DVD, where Michael is annoyed by this, you know?
DVD里有一个非常有趣的删减片段，迈克尔对此感到很恼火，你知道吗？

870
00:35:05.200 --> 00:35:10.200
He feels like somehow they're, it's like they feel like somehow something's going to be taken away from them.
他觉得他们好像……就好像他们觉得有什么东西要被抢走了一样。

871
00:35:10.320 --> 00:35:13.160
So Michael makes this big speech, and he says,
于是迈克尔发表了一通长篇大论，他说，

872
00:35:13.320 --> 00:35:18.500
would you rather have 50% of something or 100% of nothing?
你是想要百分之百的零，还是百分之五十的收益？

873
00:35:19.320 --> 00:35:19.880
Exactly.
没错。

874
00:35:20.660 --> 00:35:28.000
And everyone's like, well, when you put it that way, like Stanley's like, oh, yeah, that's, this is like passive income for me, yeah.
大家都觉得，嗯，你这么一说，就像斯坦利说的，哦，对，这对我来说就像被动收入，没错。

875
00:35:28.520 --> 00:35:30.840
And Dwight's like, that's not helping, Michael.
而德怀特却说，迈克尔，这根本没用。

876
00:35:32.420 --> 00:35:38.700
Well, next, Michael is going to enter Daryl's office, and he's going to say to Daryl,
接下来，迈克尔走进达里尔的办公室，他对达里尔说，

877
00:35:39.180 --> 00:35:44.640
hey, this idea is a lot like one you came to me with a while ago that I kind of squashed.
嘿，这个主意和你很久以前向我提过的一个很像，当时我把它给否了。

878
00:35:44.800 --> 00:35:46.620
And he's like, I blew it, I'm sorry.
他说，我搞砸了，我很抱歉。

879
00:35:46.620 --> 00:35:51.960
Yeah, but Daryl is like, it's all right, we're cool, it's fine, I'm glad they're doing it.
是啊，但达里尔说，没关系，我们很好，没事的，我很高兴他们能这么做。

880
00:35:52.140 --> 00:35:54.440
But you know, that's not where this story is going to end.
但你知道，故事并没有到此结束。

881
00:35:54.640 --> 00:35:55.560
No, it's not.
不，并没有。

882
00:35:56.160 --> 00:36:00.480
In the kitchen, everyone is really excited about this coupon book.
在厨房里，大家对这本优惠券手册感到非常兴奋。

883
00:36:00.560 --> 00:36:10.180
And Oscar is the only person all day long that is like, you guys, you realize this coupon book isn't actually worth $15,000, you know?
而奥斯卡是整整一天里唯一一个说，伙计们，你们难道没意识到这本优惠券手册根本不值一万五千美元吗？的人。

884
00:36:10.640 --> 00:36:14.340
He's the only person who seems to understand how a coupon book works,
他是唯一一个似乎明白优惠券手册是怎么运作的人，

885
00:36:14.340 --> 00:36:18.100
which is that first you have to purchase something to get the savings.
那就是你必须先买东西才能省钱。

886
00:36:18.480 --> 00:36:20.980
It's only worth what Pam paid for it.
它只值帕姆买它时花的钱。

887
00:36:21.080 --> 00:36:22.480
These coupon books cost money.
这些优惠券手册是要花钱买的。

888
00:36:22.680 --> 00:36:24.520
Did you have these when you were growing up?
你小时候有这种东西吗？

889
00:36:24.920 --> 00:36:26.360
We had these for fundraisers.
我们以前筹款时会有这种手册。

890
00:36:27.080 --> 00:36:27.660
Oh, yeah.
哦，对。

891
00:36:28.260 --> 00:36:30.620
And I loved looking through them.
我以前很喜欢翻看它们。

892
00:36:30.940 --> 00:36:34.180
Because you'd be like, oh, I can get free fries at McDonald's,
因为你会觉得，哦，我可以在麦当劳免费领薯条，

893
00:36:34.240 --> 00:36:37.460
or you can get like, buy one, get one free ticket to Six Flags.
或者你可以买一张六旗乐园的门票，买一送一之类的。

894
00:36:37.660 --> 00:36:37.880
Yeah.
没错。

895
00:36:37.880 --> 00:36:41.060
Well, Danny is going to invite everyone to his bar.
丹尼邀请了所有人去他的酒吧。

896
00:36:41.580 --> 00:36:44.420
Super cute Danny Cordray co-owns the bar.
超级可爱的丹尼·科德雷是那家酒吧的共同所有人。

897
00:36:44.680 --> 00:36:46.200
I'm not attracted to it.
我对他没感觉。

898
00:36:46.380 --> 00:36:47.160
I'm not.
真的没有。

899
00:36:47.280 --> 00:36:53.960
I'm not attracted to Danny Cordray, bar owner, with the super ironic name, public school.
我对酒吧老板丹尼·科德雷没感觉，尽管他的酒吧名字叫“公立学校”，非常讽刺。

900
00:36:54.060 --> 00:36:55.860
You know, Oscar doesn't seem impressed either.
你知道，奥斯卡似乎也没被打动。

901
00:36:56.100 --> 00:36:57.520
Oscar loves it.
奥斯卡很喜欢。

902
00:36:57.680 --> 00:36:59.980
He goes, public school, that's hilarious.
他说，公立学校，那太搞笑了。

903
00:37:00.080 --> 00:37:00.880
A plus.
满分。

904
00:37:00.920 --> 00:37:03.000
I felt like he was being snarky.
我觉得他当时是在讽刺。

905
00:37:03.140 --> 00:37:03.920
No, no.
不，不是。

906
00:37:04.100 --> 00:37:05.000
You think that's genuine?
你觉得那是真心的吗？

907
00:37:05.220 --> 00:37:06.280
I went to the script.
我回去看了剧本。

908
00:37:06.800 --> 00:37:07.280
And?
然后呢？

909
00:37:07.480 --> 00:37:12.540
The stage direction is that Oscar is like, clearly like, trying to flirt.
剧本里的舞台指示是，奥斯卡显然是在试图调情。

910
00:37:12.960 --> 00:37:14.400
Oh, like he's enamored?
哦，就像他被迷住了？

911
00:37:14.520 --> 00:37:15.620
Yes, he's enamored.
是的，他被迷住了。

912
00:37:15.760 --> 00:37:18.120
And then as he says, it's hilarious.
然后当他说那太搞笑了的时候。

913
00:37:18.360 --> 00:37:19.380
Then he's like, embarrassed.
接着他表现得很尴尬。

914
00:37:19.580 --> 00:37:20.420
And then he's like, A plus.
然后他说，满分。

915
00:37:20.420 --> 00:37:21.680
And he kind of backs away.
接着他退缩了。

916
00:37:21.820 --> 00:37:24.460
Well, let me say, that makes sense to me.
好吧，我得说，这对我来说说得通。

917
00:37:24.580 --> 00:37:28.420
But I think he's faking his admiration of the bar to flirt.
但我认为他是在假装赞赏那家酒吧，为了调情。

918
00:37:28.900 --> 00:37:31.760
I think down deep, Oscar and I feel the same way.
我觉得在内心深处，奥斯卡和我的感觉是一样的。

919
00:37:31.900 --> 00:37:32.220
Okay.
好吧。

920
00:37:32.960 --> 00:37:36.580
Well, I wanted to know if there really is a public school bar.
嗯，我想知道是否真的有一家叫“公立学校”的酒吧。

921
00:37:37.040 --> 00:37:43.840
I went online, and Jenna, there is a public school restaurant and bar in Sherman Oaks, not too far from where we filmed.
我上网查了，珍娜，在谢尔曼奥克斯确实有一家“公立学校”餐厅和酒吧，离我们拍摄的地方不远。

922
00:37:44.040 --> 00:37:44.880
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

923
00:37:45.020 --> 00:37:46.620
I wonder if that's where they got the name.
我在想他们是不是从那儿得来的名字。

924
00:37:46.680 --> 00:37:48.180
Because there's not one in Scranton, right?
因为斯克兰顿没有那家店，对吧？

925
00:37:48.180 --> 00:37:48.600
There's not.
确实没有。

926
00:37:48.700 --> 00:37:49.100
I looked.
我查过了。

927
00:37:49.280 --> 00:37:50.800
What kind of stuff do they serve?
他们供应什么样的东西？

928
00:37:51.640 --> 00:37:53.360
Looks like bar food.
看起来像是酒吧食物。

929
00:37:53.740 --> 00:37:54.500
American fare?
美式餐点？

930
00:37:54.700 --> 00:37:54.940
Yeah.
是的。

931
00:37:55.280 --> 00:37:55.800
All right.
好吧。

932
00:37:55.960 --> 00:37:56.460
There you go.
就是这样。

933
00:37:56.460 --> 00:37:57.940
There is a public school bar.
确实有一家“公立学校”酒吧。

934
00:37:58.500 --> 00:38:01.700
Next up, there's some gossip in the break room.
接下来，休息室里有一些八卦。

935
00:38:02.320 --> 00:38:03.480
There really is.
确实有。

936
00:38:03.660 --> 00:38:09.300
I mean, just people just chitty-chatting about Jim and Pam and Danny Cordray.
我是说，大家都在闲聊关于吉姆、帕姆和丹尼·科德雷的事。

937
00:38:09.460 --> 00:38:11.360
They clearly needed a little drama.
他们显然需要一点戏剧性。

938
00:38:11.580 --> 00:38:12.580
They needed something.
他们需要点什么。

939
00:38:12.980 --> 00:38:16.460
Everyone is still stuck on the fact that Pam dated Danny.
每个人都还纠结于帕姆和丹尼约会过的事实。

940
00:38:16.860 --> 00:38:17.180
Yeah.
是啊。

941
00:38:17.700 --> 00:38:22.780
They're like discussing, is Pam going to choose Jim or Danny?
他们就像在讨论，帕姆会选吉姆还是丹尼？

942
00:38:23.360 --> 00:38:25.780
She's married and has a child with Jim.
她已经结婚了，还和吉姆有个孩子。

943
00:38:25.780 --> 00:38:26.900
They went to the wedding.
他们还参加了婚礼。

944
00:38:28.020 --> 00:38:29.120
They're happy.
他们很幸福。

945
00:38:29.480 --> 00:38:30.780
Like, what is going on?
这到底是怎么回事？

946
00:38:31.260 --> 00:38:37.460
Dwight interrupts everyone and says, listen, Pam will choose whichever guy's scent most matches that of her father.
德怀特打断了所有人，说，听着，帕姆会选择那个气味最像她父亲的男人。

947
00:38:38.000 --> 00:38:41.120
And then he's like, does anyone know what her dad smelled like?
