奥斯卡赢了。

1559
01:06:53.010 --> 01:06:53.410
Yeah.
没错。

1560
01:06:53.830 --> 01:06:55.970
There was a scene that would have come after this.
本来在这之后还有一个场景。

1561
01:06:56.130 --> 01:06:57.310
It's in Deleted Scenes.
在删减片段里。

1562
01:06:57.750 --> 01:07:02.790
Creed, Meredith, Ryan, Kelly, and Angela have gathered around Oscar as he reads from the coupon book.
克里德、梅雷迪斯、瑞安、凯利和安吉拉围在奥斯卡身边，听他读优惠券手册上的内容。

1563
01:07:02.790 --> 01:07:04.170
Oh, I love this.
噢，我喜欢这个。

1564
01:07:04.410 --> 01:07:06.730
I feel like they gave Oscar a lot of alts for this.
我觉得他们为奥斯卡这段戏准备了很多备选台词。

1565
01:07:06.890 --> 01:07:10.690
Here are a few that were in the script as well as deleted scenes.
以下是剧本和删减片段中的几条。

1566
01:07:11.190 --> 01:07:12.210
Oscar says,
奥斯卡说，

1567
01:07:12.530 --> 01:07:16.650
Who wants $30 off any full fare ticket on a flight to Chicago?
谁想要一张去芝加哥的全价机票，立减30美元？

1568
01:07:17.090 --> 01:07:18.290
Blackout dates apply.
不适用日期限制。

1569
01:07:19.930 --> 01:07:23.190
Who wants a free power boost at Body Shake's Boba Bar?
谁想要Body Shake波霸吧的免费能量提升？

1570
01:07:23.950 --> 01:07:29.330
Who wants a 100 megabyte MP3 player special bonus does not play iTunes?
谁想要一个100兆的MP3播放器，特别优惠，不支持iTunes？

1571
01:07:29.910 --> 01:07:32.210
Who wants a free estimate on carpet cleaning?
谁想要免费的地毯清洁估价？

1572
01:07:32.950 --> 01:07:33.810
Oh, look.
噢，看。

1573
01:07:33.950 --> 01:07:35.870
5% off your Dunder Mifflin order.
邓德·米福林订单九五折。

1574
01:07:36.130 --> 01:07:37.890
Ask for Stan the Man.
找“斯坦大叔”就行。

1575
01:07:38.090 --> 01:07:42.990
And then the camera reveals a smiling photo of Stanley from 20 years ago.
然后镜头展示了一张斯坦利20年前微笑着的照片。

1576
01:07:43.450 --> 01:07:44.610
I have a question.
我有个问题。

1577
01:07:44.610 --> 01:07:46.890
How are people reacting in the scene?
场景里的人是什么反应？

1578
01:07:46.990 --> 01:07:47.970
Are they getting it?
他们明白了吗？

1579
01:07:48.050 --> 01:07:51.130
Are they, like, finally getting that maybe the coupon book wasn't great?
他们是不是终于意识到这本优惠券手册可能不怎么样了？

1580
01:07:51.210 --> 01:07:53.390
Or are they still wishing they had the coupon book?
还是说他们依然希望自己能得到那本手册？

1581
01:07:53.610 --> 01:07:54.010
No.
没有。

1582
01:07:54.110 --> 01:07:54.830
With each one, they're like,
每读一条，他们的反应都是，

1583
01:07:54.930 --> 01:07:55.650
Ah, pass.
啊，跳过。

1584
01:07:55.810 --> 01:07:55.890
Ah.
啊。

1585
01:07:55.890 --> 01:07:59.150
And then Kelly's like, Oscar, get to the good stuff.
然后凯利说，奥斯卡，读点好东西吧。

1586
01:07:59.510 --> 01:08:02.050
And then that's when he gets to Stan the Man.
然后他就读到了“斯坦大叔”那条。

1587
01:08:02.530 --> 01:08:03.350
That's great.
太棒了。

1588
01:08:04.050 --> 01:08:07.770
Oh, well, guys, that was Costume ConteSt.
噢，好了，伙计们，这就是《服装大赛》。

1589
01:08:07.970 --> 01:08:10.090
Yes, we hope you have a great week.
是的，希望你们度过愉快的一周。

1590
01:08:10.090 --> 01:08:11.110
Thanks for listening.
感谢收听。

1591
01:08:11.350 --> 01:08:12.690
Thank you, Randy Cordray.
谢谢你，兰迪·科德雷。

1592
01:08:12.890 --> 01:08:17.450
And thanks to Phil Rosenthal for coming in and eating some, in my opinion, disgusting chips.
也感谢菲尔·罗森塔尔能来，还吃了一些在我看来很恶心的薯片。

1593
01:08:17.670 --> 01:08:19.550
And thank you to all of you.
也谢谢你们所有人。

1594
01:08:19.650 --> 01:08:20.110
Yes.
是的。

1595
01:08:20.310 --> 01:08:23.750
For sending in all your wonderful messages and gifts.
感谢你们寄来所有精彩的留言和礼物。

1596
01:08:23.990 --> 01:08:24.850
We love you.
我们爱你们。

1597
01:08:24.850 --> 01:08:26.290
We love you so much.
我们非常爱你们。

1598
01:08:26.390 --> 01:08:27.270
See you next week.
下周见。

1599
01:08:27.450 --> 01:08:27.690
Bye.
再见。

1600
01:08:33.400 --> 01:08:35.440
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies.
感谢收听《办公室女士》。

